Reliquary Environments

The initial stateful-tools environment is derived from MIT-licensed Reliquary
code at commit 656c86227b7cd5a96676c3e88e31412ababf464c.

Original paths:
  reliquary/environment/agentic/envs/stateful_tools_v1/environment.py
  reliquary/environment/agentic/envs/stateful_tools_v1/tasks.py
  reliquary/environment/agentic/envs/stateful_tools_v1/tools.py
  reliquary/environment/agentic/envs/stateful_tools_v1/verifier.py

The standalone port keeps the procedural task families and exact-state reward
principle, replaces the in-process SQLite object with JSON-serializable state,
and adds native Verifiers v1 plus a Reliquary-free synchronous JSON
compatibility surface. The original MIT notice is retained in LICENSE.

The reliquary-math and reliquary-code environments are trained on the
following third-party corpora:

OpenMathInstruct-2 (nvidia/OpenMathInstruct-2), CC-BY-4.0.
OpenCodeInstruct (nvidia/OpenCodeInstruct), CC-BY-4.0, via the curated subset
R0mAI/opencodeinstruct-curated.
